{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You sell, make money, or not.  It's all about <strong>strategy</strong>: what to prioritise, when to raise prices or go into a price war with your competitor, and much more. An oversight might cost you a few bucks or millions. You keep lines moving. You <strong>outsmart</strong> rivals, ride the good days, and <strong>survive</strong> the bad ones. A <i><strong>tycoon/management simulation</strong></i> about starting small, getting better, and making it big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/ea66bd3ac05c846916d00ec229f686ab.poster.avif?t=1762563900\" width=766 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/ea66bd3ac05c846916d00ec229f686ab.webm?t=1762563900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/ea66bd3ac05c846916d00ec229f686ab.mp4?t=1762563900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Lee\u2019s challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/c30d2ea0aae6f10b3671348a74140075.avif?t=1762563900\" width=766 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning, the richest entrepreneur alive sips Yorkshire tea and thinks about the one thing he never found: a true successor. So, he builds a test anyone can try. A business challenge based on one of his first hustles. He calls it <i>Business Heroes: Street Grub</i>. Pass his challenge, and you prove you\u2019ve got the heart and the brains to lead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your mission</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a food-truck business that lasts. Grow so fast that it bothers your rivals. Meet the hidden conditions Master Lee set along the way. If you go bankrupt, you lose. If you stay sharp, you rise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What will you do?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create burger recipes people want to buy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices that feel fair or not... but make you money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan upgrades and expansion without going bankrupt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend on marketing when it matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire, train, and keep your team steady.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to weather, events, and a changing economy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1429080/extras/83971b1d7138437411592b248008fe02.avif?t=1762563900\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, you make decisions: strategy, pricing, upgrades, hiring, marketing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you watch it play out on the street. Queues, rushes, reviews, surprises. No fluff. Just your decisions, working... or not.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense moments you\u2019ll remember</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling out right before sunset.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipping a price war and winning the crowd back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catching glowing reviews that make tomorrow\u2019s line longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riding an economic boom and opening the next stand.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is it for?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who like strategy. If management games calm your brain and good decisions make your day, you\u2019ll feel at home here. This is perfect to play while working or studying.\u00a0Decide, press Play, and come back a few minutes later to see how the day went.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>While we don't use AI for art generation, we do embrace it as an assistive tool to improve our workflow. We use AI-powered features for code prediction to streamline development and to help us review, shorten, and simplify our writing for better clarity.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Burger Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1429080/56e0e8b0edb616953aa8c5e556a21a568d47ef37.jpg"},{"name":"Burger Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1429080/d204bd1ab095b191b3bde497d7620ae35b023e01.jpg"},{"name":"Burger Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1429080/290ea3a9f589fb1168e0560715687d62dbd69e44.jpg"},{"name":"Burger Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1429080/7c75defafdefd28a27cc9578da50123cc6fc0cf9.jpg"},{"name":"One-Stand Whopper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1429080/7907d6dd810f9df4d2ccc9c84057c19764bc74b9.jpg"},{"name":"Refreshment Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1429080/3cd07507cf3a0ea781f2ae63d2a39875778afb96.jpg"},{"name":"Liquid Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1429080/63c21f19ec92e2c9cbb67f0c2487426c168ab1e1.jpg"},{"name":"Drink Mogul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1429080/c4dd905ad8f5a0470de69d774f49561a818d6eea.jpg"},{"name":"Liquid Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1429080/e73efb76ef121bc904b1e8bc46b86b36faeec32d.jpg"},{"name":"Thirst Quencher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1429080/8c2fb88a296b878a25ff9c0a93a553094cc048aa.jpg"}],"total":100},"background":"https://store.akamai.stea